\fs28 Solution Architecture Overview\b0\fs22\par
The Support Ticket Intelligence and Agentforce Analysis solution is designed to automate support-ticket processing, improve ticket prioritization, reduce manual effort, and provide quick conversational access to ticket information. The solution uses Salesforce as the primary platform, with Auto-Launched Flow for workflow automation and Agentforce for AI-based ticket analysis.\par
\b\fs28 Goals of the Solution Architecture\b0\fs22\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl259\slmult0 Identify an effective technology solution for support-ticket management.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Automate ticket priority classification and support-agent assignment.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Reduce manual effort in Task creation and ticket processing.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Provide SLA risk awareness for support agents.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Enable conversational ticket analysis using Agentforce.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Provide a scalable and secure Salesforce-based architecture.\par
\pard\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b\fs28 Architecture Components & Data Flow\b0\fs22\par
\b User Layer\b0\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl259\slmult0 Support agents interact with the system through the Salesforce interface.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Users can create, view, and manage support tickets.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Agents can use Agentforce to ask questions about tickets and receive analysis.\par
\pard\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b Application / Workflow Layer\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b0 Salesforce manages Cases, Accounts, Contacts, Users, and Tasks.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Auto-Launched Flow processes ticket information automatically.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Flow Decision evaluates ticket priority and configured conditions.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Flow assigns tickets to the appropriate support agent or queue.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Flow creates Tasks for High/Critical priority tickets.\par
\pard\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b AI Layer\b0\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl259\slmult0 Agentforce analyzes the ticket subject and description.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Support Ticket Priority Analysis Subagent identifies urgency, impact, and suggested priority.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Agentforce provides ticket summaries and recommended next actions.\par
\pard\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b Database Layer\b0\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl259\slmult0 Support_Ticket_Intelligence__c stores ticket intelligence information.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Salesforce records store Account, Contact, User, Case, and Task information.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Salesforce provides secure and scalable cloud-based data storage.\par
\pard\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b SLA & Monitoring Layer\b0\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl259\slmult0 Flow checks SLA-related conditions for open tickets.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Tickets approaching SLA deadlines can be marked as At Risk.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}SLA-breach risks can be communicated to the assigned support agent.\par
\pard\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b Security Layer\b0\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl259\slmult0 Salesforce authentication and authorization control system access.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Profiles and Permission Sets control user permissions.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Sharing Rules control record-level access.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Field-Level Security protects sensitive customer and ticket information.\par
\pard\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b\fs28 Data Flow Description\par
\fs22 Step-by-Step Flow\par
\pard{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}{\*\pn\pnlvlblt\pnf1\pnindent0{\pntxtb\'B7}}\fi-360\li720\sa160\sl259\slmult0\b0 Support agent accesses Salesforce and creates or opens a support ticket.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Account and Contact information is associated with the ticket.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Agentforce analyzes the ticket description using the Support Ticket Priority Analysis Subagent.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Auto-Launched Flow receives the ticket information and starts processing.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Flow Decision determines the appropriate ticket priority.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}If the ticket is High/Critical, Flow automatically creates a Task.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Flow assigns the ticket to the appropriate support agent or queue.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}SLA Risk Check evaluates whether the ticket is approaching its SLA deadline.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}The processed information is stored in Salesforce records.\par
{\pntext\f1\'B7\tab}Agentforce provides the final conversational response with ticket summary, priority, SLA status, and recommended action.\par
